{"unit_id":"tag:0420:proof","translation":"我们将用引理<REF_0001>证明这一点。该引理的假设(1)和(2)由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0002>得到。考虑<MATH_0002>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的笛卡尔（cartesian）图（diagram）<MATH_0001>，其中<MATH_0003>是仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射的（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0004>是一个闭浸入（closed immersion）。我们必须证明<MATH_0005>是一个闭浸入（closed immersion）。态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>是仿射的（affine）。因此，由引理<REF_0003>可知<MATH_0007>是一个概形（scheme），且<MATH_0008>是仿射的（affine）。由《下降（Descent）》的引理<REF_0004>得到<MATH_0009>是一个闭浸入（closed immersion），如所欲证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"章节名称，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔","context":"图性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"交换图，待决。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"章节名称，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0421:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是分离的（separated）”是fpqc基底局部的（local on the base）。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0421:proof","translation":"分离的（separated）态射（morphism）的基底变换（base change）是分离的（separated），见《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0001>。因此得到定义<REF_0002>中的正向蕴含。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。设<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。假设每个基底变换（base change）<MATH_0005>都是分离的（separated）。这意味着每个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0006>都是一个闭浸入（closed immersion）。fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）的基底变换（base change）是fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering），见《空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》的引理<REF_0003>，因此<MATH_0007>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。此外，每个<MATH_0008>都是态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>的基底变换（base change）。因此，由引理<REF_0004>得到<MATH_0010>是一个闭浸入（closed immersion），即<MATH_0011>是分离的（separated）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换","context":"运算，待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"章节名称，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖","context":"覆盖，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"章节名称，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
