{"unit_id":"tag:0423:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是拟仿射的（quasi-affine）”是fpqc基底局部的（local on the base）。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射的"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0423:proof","translation":"我们将用引理<REF_0001>证明这一点。该引理的假设(1)和(2)由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0002>得到。设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射的（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），并假设基底变换（base change）<MATH_0004>是拟仿射的（quasi-affine）。设<MATH_0005>是表示<MATH_0006>的概形（scheme）。我们得到一个典范同构（canonical isomorphism）<MATH_0007>，因为两个概形（schemes）都表示代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0008>。这是<MATH_0009>的一个下降（descent）数据，见《下降（Descent）》的定义<REF_0003>（验证略去，与《下降（Descent）》的引理<REF_0004>比较）。由于<MATH_0010>是拟仿射的（quasi-affine），这个下降（descent）数据是有效的（effective），见《下降（Descent）》的引理<REF_0005>。因此，存在<MATH_0012>上的概形（scheme）<MATH_0011>以及与下降（descent）数据相容的同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0013>。当然，<MATH_0014>是拟仿射的（quasi-affine）（由构造或《下降（Descent）》的引理<REF_0006>）。注意<MATH_0015>是一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering），将<MATH_0016>解释为<MATH_0017>的元素（element），可知<MATH_0018>。由<MATH_0019>的层条件（sheaf condition）（见《空间的性质》的命题<REF_0007>），我们得到一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0020>。由构造，它到<MATH_0021>的基底变换（base change）是一个同构（isomorphism），因此由引理<REF_0008>，它是一个同构（isomorphism）。这证明<MATH_0022>可由一个拟仿射的（quasi-affine）概形（scheme）表示（representable），从而得证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射的"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射的"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射的"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射的"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"章节名称，待决。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换","context":"运算，待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构","context":"比较映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据，待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"章节名称，待决。"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的","context":"下降数据性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖","context":"覆盖，待决。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件","context":"粘合性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示","context":"可表性，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
